sources.example_request:
POST https://overpass-api.de/api/interpreter with form body data=<query> (or GET ?data=<urlencoded query>):
[out:json][timeout:25];
is_in(38.8977,-77.0365)->.a;
rel(pivot.a)[boundary=administrative];
out tags bb;
rel(pivot.a)[place];
out tags bb;
way(around:25,38.8977,-77.0365)[building];
out tags geom;
rel(around:25,38.8977,-77.0365)[building];
out tags geom;
way(around:80,38.8977,-77.0365)[highway][name];
out tags geom;

-> returns every administrative relation containing the point (id, name, admin_level, wikidata, border_type, start_date if tagged, bbox), any place=* area relations (neighbourhood/quarter), the building footprint(s) with full geometry and tags (building, building:levels, start_date, addr:*, historic, heritage, old_name, wikidata), and the surrounding named streets (name, highway, name:etymology, name:etymology:wikidata, old_name, start_date) whose geometry defines the 'block'.

GET https://query.wikidata.org/sparql?format=json&query=<encodeURIComponent(QUERY)>   (or POST application/x-www-form-urlencoded body query=... for long queries; both avoid a preflight)

QUERY A - everything with coordinates within 500 m of the address, with inception, NRHP id and heritage status:
SELECT ?item ?itemLabel ?loc ?dist ?inception ?nrhp ?heritageLabel ?typeLabel WHERE {
  SERVICE wikibase:around {
    ?item wdt:P625 ?loc .
    bd:serviceParam wikibase:center "Point(-77.0365 38.8977)"^^geo:wktLiteral ;
                    wikibase:radius "0.5" ;
                    wikibase:distance ?dist .
  }
  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P31 ?type }
  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P571 ?inception }
  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P649 ?nrhp }
  OPTIONAL { ?item wdt:P1435 ?heritage }
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en" }
} ORDER BY ?dist LIMIT 100

QUERY B - admin hierarchy chain (rings) from a known item, with inception/dissolution and time-qualified membership:
SELECT ?admin ?adminLabel ?typeLabel ?start ?end ?inception ?dissolved WHERE {
  wd:Q35525 wdt:P131+ ?admin .
  OPTIONAL { ?admin wdt:P31 ?type }
  OPTIONAL { ?admin wdt:P571 ?inception }
  OPTIONAL { ?admin wdt:P576 ?dissolved }
  OPTIONAL { ?x p:P131 ?st . ?st ps:P131 ?admin . OPTIONAL { ?st pq:P580 ?start } OPTIONAL { ?st pq:P582 ?end } FILTER(?x = wd:Q35525) }
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en" }
}

QUERY C - population time series for the city ring (P1082 with point-in-time P585):
SELECT ?pop ?when WHERE { wd:Q61 p:P1082 ?s . ?s ps:P1082 ?pop ; pq:P585 ?when . } ORDER BY ?when

QUERY D - streets near the point and what they are named after (P138):
SELECT ?street ?streetLabel ?namesake ?namesakeLabel ?dist WHERE {
  SERVICE wikibase:around { ?street wdt:P625 ?loc . bd:serviceParam wikibase:center "Point(-77.0365 38.8977)"^^geo:wktLiteral ; wikibase:radius "1" ; wikibase:distance ?dist . }
  ?street wdt:P31/wdt:P279* wd:Q79007 .
  OPTIONAL { ?street wdt:P138 ?namesake }
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en" }
} ORDER BY ?dist
